      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNadabi loAbihu, amadodana kaAroni, bathatha imiganu yabo yokutshisela impepha, bafaka umlilo kiyo, babeka kiyo impepha, banikela ngomlilo ongafanele eNkosini eyayingabalayanga wona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwavela umlilo eNkosini, wabaqothula, bafela phambi kweNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wasesithi kuAroni: Yikho lokhu iNkosi eyakutsho isithi: Ngizakuzibonakalisa ukuthi ngingcwele ngalabo abaseduze lami, futhi ngizakuba lodumo phambi kwabantu bonke. UAroni wathula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wabiza uMishayeli loElizafani, amadodana kaUziyeli isihlobo sikaAroni wathi kibo: Sondelani, libasuse abafowenu ngaphambi kwendlu engcwele, libakhuphele ngaphandle kwezihonqo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basondelake, babathwala bembethe amabhatshi abo, babakhuphela ngaphandle kwezihonqo, njengokutsho kukaMose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wathi kuAroni lakuEleyazare loIthamari, amadodana akhe: Lingayekeli ukuba inwele zamakhanda enu zithukuluke, lingadabuli ingubo zenu ekukhaleni kwenu, funa life, lolaka lukaNkulunkulu lwehlele phezu kwebandla lonke. Kodwa abakini, yonke indlu kaIsrayeli, bangakhala ngokutshisa okwenziwe yiNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lingaphumi ngomnyango wethente lokuhlangana ukuba lingafi, ngoba amagcobo okugcoba kweNkosi aphezu kwenu. Benzake njengelizwi likaMose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yakhuluma kuAroni yathi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unganathi iwayini lotshwala, wena lamadodana akho, nxa lingena ethenteni lokuhlangana ukuba lingafi. Lokhu kuzakuba yisimiso esingelakuphela ezizukulwaneni zenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lizakwehlukanisa okungcwele lokungangcwele, lokuhlambulukileyo lokungahlambulukanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lifundise abantu bakoIsrayeli zonke izimiso iNkosi ezikhulume kubo ngoMose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wathi kuAroni lakuEleyazare loIthamari, amadodana akhe aseleyo: Thathani umnikelo wempuphu oseleyo eminikelweni eyenzelwe iNkosi ngomlilo, liwudle ungelamvubelo ngaseceleni kwealtare, ngoba ungcwele kakhulu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.6.14+LEV.6.15+LEV.6.16+LEV.6.17+LEV.6.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 6:14–18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "liwudlele endaweni engcwele, ngoba uyisabelo sakho lesabelo samadodana akho, esivela eminikelweni eyenzelwe iNkosi ngomlilo; ngoba ngiyalaywa kunjalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa isifuba esizunguzwayo lomlenze onikelwayo lizakukudlela endaweni ehlambulukileyo, wena lamadodana akho, lamadodakazi akho; ngoba kunikwe ukuba yisabelo sakho lesabelo samadodana akho, kuvela emihlatshelweni yeminikelo yokuthula yabantu bakoIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.7.30+LEV.7.31+LEV.7.32+LEV.7.33+LEV.7.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 7:30–34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umlenze onikelwayo lesifuba esizunguzwayo bazakukuletha kanye leminikelo yamahwahwa eyenziwe ngomlilo, ukuze kuzunguzwe, kube ngumnikelo wokuzunguzwa phambi kweNkosi, kube yisabelo sakho lesamadodana akho kokuphela, njengokulaya kweNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wabuzisisa ngembuzi yomnikelo wesono, wabona ukuthi yayitshisiwe. Wathukuthelela uEleyazare loIthamari, amadodana kaAroni aseleyo, wathi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalidlanga ngani umnikelo wesono endaweni yendlu engcwele, ngoba ungcwele kakhulu, futhi liphiwe wona ukuba lithwale ububi bebandla, libenzele indlela yokubuyisana phambi kweNkosi na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.6.24+LEV.6.25+LEV.6.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 6:24–26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khangelani, igazi lawo kalingeniswanga endlini engcwele. Ngabe liyidlile endlini engcwele njengokulaya kwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAroni wathi kuMose: Khangela, lamhla sebenikele umnikelo wabo wesono lomnikelo wabo wokutshiswa eNkosini, kantike ngehlelwe yilokhu mina! Uba bengidlile umnikelo wesono lamuhla, bekuzakwamukeleka emehlweni eNkosi na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esezwile lokho uMose wathaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
